      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ8Rasm1H7AzQRw4nrDMmhGMs/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOSlIySnFSV3hQVFdGc1pYTlRVVE5LTWpWNVNuYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "9 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "點了羊排、義面和沙拉。食物出乎意料地好吃，尤其喜歡那美味的羊排配上超讚的薄荷醬。沙拉也很清爽新鮮 :)\n\n強烈推薦給所有想在輕鬆愜意的氛圍中享用美食的人！",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Had the lamb chops, pasta and a salad. Food was surprisingly good and loved the fact the amazing lamb chops were served with a really good mint sauce. The salad was really crisp and fresh as well :)\n\nWould really recommend to anyone looking for great food with a chilled, laid back atmosphere!",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
